      "module": "lesen",
      "title": "A Family Trip to the Mountains",
      "text": "Last summer, my family decided to go on a hiking trip in the mountains. We wanted to spend some time away (1) __________ the busy city life. We packed our bags and drove for five hours until we reached a small village. The air was much fresher there (2) __________ it was at home. On the first day, we climbed a steep hill. It was quite difficult, but the view from the top was worth (3) __________ effort. My brother, who is usually lazy, enjoyed the walk more (4) __________ he expected. We stayed in a wooden cabin that had no internet, which was strange at first, (5) __________ we soon got used to it. We spent our evenings playing board games and talking. It was the (6) __________ relaxing holiday we have had in years.",
